[11712]="700613A4\n1\tCollect Gamwich herbs (total: 7)\tGather some herbs along the river east of Gamwich. Bring them to Wingard Puddifoot back in town.\n2\tTalk to Wingard Puddifoot\tWingard Puddifoot can be found back in Gamwich. Return to Wingard Puddifoot.\n",
